    "detailed_description": "Slay the Dungeon is inspired by 2 of our favorite games, Slay the Spire and Darkest Dungeon. Where you can <strong>build</strong> your own characters, <strong>recruit</strong> teammates, <strong>loot</strong>\u00a0plenty of item sets, <strong>discover</strong> powerful relics and Slay the Dungeon.<br><br>\ud83d\udccc <strong>FEATURES</strong> \ud83d\udccc<br>- <strong>Dynamic Character Customization</strong>: The equipment you wear defines who you are<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2694620/extras/f39d443afd2eeb252f20b9d7c3052cde.avif?t=1708960612\" width=614 height=378 /></span><br><br>- <strong>Deep Character System</strong>: Build your own team with the unique companions to venture deep inside the darkest dungeons<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2694620/extras/c132b5e263a7db87a0c3a3defaa4ebfc.avif?t=1708960612\" width=614 height=380 /></span><br><br>- <strong>An Unexpected Journey</strong>: The Dungeon is change every time. Your journey is based on your decisions.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2694620/extras/3c183bc6b24f12420739a1a13360fca2.avif?t=1708960612\" width=615 height=471 /></span><br><br>- <strong>Powerful Relics to Discover</strong>: Relics can be found throughout the Dungeon. The effects of these relics can greatly enhance your team, but beware, obtaining a relic may cost you more than just gold.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2694620/extras/fe96906004a1c756580eab141d18139a.avif?t=1708960612\" width=614 height=246 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2694620/extras/c60aa4406210c1d0e7267a8e73c8c179.avif?t=1708960612\" width=614 height=346 /></span>",
